# Weightless containers: the store's Loot Bag (data/scripts/chaos/pouches.lua, pouches_config.lua `weightless`) carries
# all the loot it collects without weight (owner: "uma bag sem fundo que pode carregar todo o loot que o jogador recebe
# automaticamente"). A container type registered with Game.setWeightlessContainer(itemId) at startup: its own weight is
# the item's (Container::getWeight), the weight of what lies in it never reaches the containers it lies in or the
# player's inventory weight (Container::updateItemWeight stops there), and an item put into it (or into a bag inside it)
# skips the holder's capacity check (Container::queryAdd asks the top parent with FLAG_NOLIMIT). The slot limit stays the
# container's size (items.xml containerSize, at most 255 in this protocol). No save format change: the type set is
# filled from Lua each start. Built against the chain 0001-0037 (server/README.md "Store pouches", Loot Bag).
# Guard: tools/weightless_patch_test.py (CI). Applies after 0001-0037.
